    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada792d00b4c9ed6833fee39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "意外就发生在一瞬之间。\n跑在前方的赛马娘因为碰撞在一起而跌倒，\n玉藻十字也因此受到了波及。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c051ad935457e695c3a169fb43b5c1684526fbbd5a7ec2266e036edc5747540f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
